aegis-base (1.3.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * New Aegis wallpaper/screensaver image: a low-key field of glossy blue
    iso-blocks (Kali-blocks style) with the glowing Aegis shield, no tagline.
  * Ship an Aegis screensaver: an xscreensaver skel config (slow pan over the
    Aegis image, no lock) plus an autostart entry.
  * Stop running fastfetch at the start of every terminal (the old
    /etc/bash.bashrc auto-run hook is removed on upgrade).
  * Add aegis-fetch: an animated "spinning shield" banner (a coin-flip rotation
    of the Aegis shield in truecolor ANSI) that resolves into the normal
    fastfetch system info. `fastfetch` / `fetch` are aliased to it in
    interactive shells; `aegis-fetch --no-spin` gives the static banner.

 -- Aegis OS <aegis@aegis-os.localdomain>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 17:49:24 +0000

aegis-base (1.2.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging: migrate kernel hardening, module blacklists and OS
    branding from the live-build hooks into a proper Debian package.
  * Branding: PRETTY_NAME is now "Aegis OS" (no "Debian" shown); os-release URLs
    point at the Aegis project.
  * fastfetch: ship an Aegis ASCII logo + config and show it in interactive
    terminals.
  * Desktop: ship the Aegis wallpaper and apply it on login.
  * Richer fastfetch (live network-mode + Tor status, palette bar).
  * Live "Switch Desktop" tool (aegis-switch-de) to change DE on the running
    live session.

 -- Aegis OS <aegis@aegis-os.localdomain>  Sat, 01 Nov 2026 09:40:00 +0000
